            <ArticleTitle>Use of epidural analgesia in post-operative pain management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>54-64; quiz 66</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article provides an overview of the use of epidural infusion analgesia in the management of patients with post-operative pain. Epidural analgesia is an effective method for relieving pain and has minimal side effects. However, life-threatening complications can occur and nurses need to be able to identify these and provide safe care for patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
